indicators.text:
Research different occupations in the accounting field to contrast:
- educational requirements;
- working conditions, including typical hours and shifts worked as well as typical locations;
- duties and skills required; and,
- professional and/or licensing requirements in Saskatchewan (CPA) and Canada.

Develop a procedural guide for the work placement that includes items such as:
- transportation to and from the work placement;
- hours of work;
- guidelines for absence and tardiness;
- dress code;
- job description; and,
- conflict resolution

